ecovery leaves retry budget available; blocking when a recovered died or hung record spends the budget or triggers the identical-signature early stop.\"\nattest/records/219/verify-01.json:76:      \"retires\": \"Automatic reruns after a stop whose answer may alter or interpret the definition of done.\",\nattest/records/219/verify-01.json:81:      \"title\": \"--again bypasses person-only stops, not just exhausted retry budgets\",\nattest/records/219/verify-01.json:82:      \"specimen\": \"attavo/drive.py::_pass_once calls _advance_again for every stopped state that is neither presently eligible nor waiting. Thus --again can restart claims-boundary, environment, gate, unanswered/person-ruled question, and patch stops, although the approved narrowing permits it only after a stage\\u2019s retry budget or early stop is spent.\",\nattest/records/219/verify-01.json:84:      \"rejection_test\": \"tests/test_retry.py::test_again_refuses_person_patch_claims_boundary_gate_and_environment_stops\",\nattest/records/219/verify-01.json:85:      \"severity\": \"Harmless without --again; blocking when --again is issued against a person-only or never-retried stop and creates a new marker.\"\nattest/records/219/verify-01.json:93:    \"tests/test_retry.py::test_again_refuses_person_patch_claims_boundary_gate_and_environment_stops\"\nattest/records/219/verify-01.json:104:  \"stop\": null,\nattest/records/158/build-05.json:44:    \"run\": \"xargs -r python3 -m pytest -q --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_every_gate_rejects --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_one_item_traversed_every_stage --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_no_commit_lacks_a_record --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_no_stop_lacks_cause --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_every_attested_item_is_sealed\",\nattest/records/158/build-05.json:49:    \"command\": \"python3 -m pytest tests -q --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_every_gate_rejects --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_one_item_traversed_every_stage 